<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">DISCOVER</view><view class="title" style="font-size:48rpx;margin-top:8rpx">去哪里，取决于<br/>你想如何生活。</view><view class="filter card" style="margin-top:30rpx"><view class="section-title" style="font-size:28rpx;margin-bottom:20rpx">目的地筛选</view><scroll-view scroll-x="true" style="white-space:nowrap;margin-bottom:24rpx"><view wx:for="{{countries}}" wx:key="*this" class="pill {{country===item?'active':''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseCountry">{{item}}</view></scroll-view><view class="grid-2"><view><view class="muted">预算（CNY）</view><input class="input" data-key="budget" value="{{budget}}" bindinput="input" type="number"/></view><view><view class="muted">出发日期</view><input class="input" data-key="date" value="{{date}}" bindinput="input"/></view><view><view class="muted">旅行天数</view><input class="input" data-key="days" value="{{days}}" bindinput="input" type="number"/></view><button class="primary" bindtap="generate">生成路线</button></view></view><view class="section-head"><view class="section-title">目的地灵感</view><view class="muted">{{country}}</view></view><view class="card destination" wx:for="{{destinations}}" wx:key="name" data-name="{{item.name}}" bindtap="openDestination"><image class="image" style="height:270rpx" mode="aspectFill" src="{{item.image}}"/><view class="row" style="margin-top:18rpx"><view><view style="font-size:32rpx;font-weight:700">{{item.name}} <text class="muted">· {{item.country}}</text></view><view class="muted" style="margin-top:8rpx">{{item.tag}}</view></view><view style="font-size:30rpx;color:#d17d57">→</view></view><view class="pay-row"><text class="pill">Visa</text><text class="pill">微信支付</text><text class="pill">{{item.local}} 结算</text></view></view></view>
